{
  "_comment": "Reference shape of the post-self-retire SessionStart stanza + top-level statusLine entry for pos-v2.\n\nOn a pos-v2 repo using true-first-run, this fragment's command string is NOT merged verbatim into the user's settings.json. Instead, the repo ships `.claude/settings.json` pointing at `hands-off-lifecycle/hooks/first-run.sh`; first-run completes setup and rewrites the SessionStart stanza to match the shape described here (venv-python + pos_session_start.py), then deletes itself. This fragment is therefore the authoritative description of the supervisor-path hook stanza the rewritten settings.json ends up with — not a hand-merge recipe. See ../README.md for the lifecycle and ../../context/pos-rebuild/components/true-first-run/ for the build brief.\n\nThe helper script never spawns a long-lived background process inheriting Claude Code's FDs (Claude Code v2.1.87 issue #43123 mitigation) — it delegates to launchctl bootstrap / systemctl --user start, which are FD-safe.\n\nOn platforms without launchd or systemd-user the script exits code 2 with the named diagnostic `platform-unsupported:<platform>` rather than degrading to a subprocess-supervisor fallback.\n\nSchema: each SessionStart entry is wrapped in the current Claude Code envelope `{matcher, hooks: [...]}`. The flat-object shape used before was accepted by an earlier Claude Code release and is rejected by the current validator.\n\nAmendment #49: the top-level `statusLine` entry registers the bootstrap-progress renderer (`hands-off-lifecycle/hooks/statusline.py`) so Claude Code spawns it every ~1 s and renders the worker's plain-English progress line at the bottom of the terminal. The renderer reads `<workspace>/.pos/first-run.state` (per amendment #28's workspace-local routing) and dispatches by status. Stdlib-only — pre-venv first runs invoke it under the system Python.",

  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "${LOAM_REPO}/.venv/bin/python ${LOAM_REPO}/orchestrator/scripts/pos_session_start.py",
            "async": false,
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },

  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "${LOAM_REPO}/.venv/bin/python ${LOAM_REPO}/hands-off-lifecycle/hooks/statusline.py",
    "refreshInterval": 1
  }
}
